Description: graphical night-light and color temperature control for X11
 X11Shift adjusts the color temperature and brightness of X11 displays using
 XRandR gamma ramps. It provides a GTK settings window, solar and custom
 schedules, smooth transitions, per-display selection, tray controls, and
 optional desktop login autostart.

